WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:03.300
There are two yarn feeders
on the main bed carriage.

2
00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:06.020
And they're used for different purposes.

3
00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:09.060
The number one feeder or the back feeder

4
00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:12.460
is used when you're knitting
with just one color.

5
00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:16.180
The number two feeder can be used
when knitting with the two colors.

6
00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:18.580
Say, for fair aisle.

7
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:21.740
Open the yarn feeder lever or the gate

8
00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:25.660
and slip the yarn into
that number one feeder.

9
00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:29.260
Make sure that the yarn feeds cleanly,

10
00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:33.460
close the gate and then slip
in another end of yarn.

11
00:00:33.490 --> 00:00:39.820
In the number two feeder, you'll feel
it sort of snap into place. Again,

12
00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:43.060
make sure the yarn passes smoothly.

13
00:00:43.090 --> 00:00:47.040
You'll explore these different feeders
as you work with stitch patterns.

